摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"LongCat (LongCat-2.0) provider for DeepSeek Harness — 1M context, thinking mode, tool calling","id":"gh:1340213946","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-llm-longcat","slug":"ffyuuu/dsh-llm-longcat","topics":["agent","ai","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","llm","llm-adapter","llm-provider","longcat","meituan"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"LongCat (LongCat-2.0) provider for DeepSeek Harness — 1M context, thinking mode, tool calling"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-llm-longcat"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"LongCat adapter for the DeepSeek Harness LLM seam."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Adds **LongCat-2.0** as a model provider: 1M context, thinking mode, tool calling."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Thinking mode** — recognizes LongCat's `reasoning_content` field and translates it into harness "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"`ReasoningBlock`s\n- **Tool calling** — full function-calling support, with `arguments` kept a raw JS"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ON string end to end\n- **Multi-turn** — replays `reasoning_content` on tool-call turns, as thinking-"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"mode passback requires\n- **Streaming** — SSE with the `usage`-before-`finish` ordering the harness r"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"elies on\n- **Credential seam** — the key resolves per request from `ctx.credentials` or the environm"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ent; no secret in any config file"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Supported models"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Model | Context | Max output | Notes |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `LongCat-2.0` | 1,048,576 | 131,072 | text-only; thinking + tool calling |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Facts from `GET /openai/v1/models/LongCat-2.0`, the only documented endpoint that\nreports `supported"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"_parameters`. Tool calling is **not** mentioned on the\nchat-completions doc page and is only visible"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ters`. Tool calling is **not** mentioned on the\nchat-completions doc page and is only visible there."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Installing a bundle lets the package's install scripts run on your machine,\noutside the sandbox the "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"agent runs under. Pin a commit so a later push cannot\nchange what executes:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Then pick **LongCat-2.0** in the model selector. The key may also be stored\nthrough the Web UI's Mod"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"els page instead of the environment."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### If `dsh` itself will not install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"At the time of writing, installing the harness can fail before any plugin is\nreached, with either `E"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"TARGET … dsh-typert-protocol@^0.1.0-rc.8` or an npm\nheap exhaustion. That is an upstream packaging s"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"tate, not this plugin:\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh` published `0.1.0-rc.8` while several packages it depends o"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"n\nstopped at `0.1.0-rc.7`, and because the manifests use caret ranges,\n`^0.1.0-rc.7` still resolves "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"up into the missing `rc.8`. npm then backtracks\nover an unsatisfiable graph until it runs out of mem"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"nto the missing `rc.8`. npm then backtracks\nover an unsatisfiable graph until it runs out of memory."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Pinning every `@deepseek-ai/*` package to an exact `0.1.0-rc.7` through npm\n`overrides` avoids the d"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"rift. Nothing in this plugin needs changing either\nway — it declares `>=0.1.0-rc.7` and works agains"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"t whichever of those the\nhost ends up with."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"A `llm-longcat:` section in `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml` overrides any field\nwithout a restart: base UR"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"L, catalog, request defaults, and idle budget all\ntake effect on the next request, while an in-fligh"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"t stream keeps the facts it\nstarted with."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Reasoning is binary, deliberately"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"LongCat controls thinking with `thinking: {type: enabled|disabled}` and does\n**not** accept OpenAI's"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" top-level `reasoning_effort` — its\n`supported_parameters` lists the former and omits the latter. Th"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ere is\ntherefore no low/medium/high gradient to map, and this adapter offers exactly\ntwo levels rath"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"er than advertising controls that would collapse onto the same\ntwo request bodies:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Selected effort | Wire body |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `high` (\"Thinking\") | `{\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"enabled\"}}` |\n| `off` | `{\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"disa"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"bled\"}}` |\n| *(none named)* | resolves from config; still explicit |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`off` serializes an explicit `disabled` rather than omitting the field —\nomitting it would hand the "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"decision to LongCat's server-side default, which is\nnot what selecting Off should mean. Requesting `"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"low`, `medium`, or `max` fails\nwith `UNSUPPORTED_REASONING_EFFORT` before any network I/O."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Wire-format notes"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- **Tool-call deltas repeat `id` and `name` as explicit `null`.** LongCat sends\nthem on the opening "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"delta and then `null` (not omitted) on every\ncontinuation, so a naive `!== undefined` guard blanks t"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"he assembled call's\nname. Verified on live traffic; pinned by a regression test.\n- Streaming only, w"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ith `stream_options.include_usage` always on. Usage may\narrive attached to the finish chunk or as a "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"trailing usage-only chunk; both\nare deferred to `[DONE]` so `usage` always precedes `finish`.\n- The "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"first thinking-mode delta can be an empty string — it must not open a\nreasoning block.\n- **Reasoning"},{"id":"p28s7","text":" passback**: on assistant turns that carried tool calls,\n`reasoning_content` is serialized back into"},{"id":"p28s8","text":" history; on tool-call-free turns\nit is dropped (ignored anyway — saves tokens).\n- Assistant `conten"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"t` is always a string, never null: the message is durable\nsession history, and a null there would ma"},{"id":"p28s10","text":"ke later turns replay a body the\nendpoint can reject.\n- Cache accounting: `prompt_tokens_details.cac"},{"id":"p28s11","text":"hed_tokens` maps to\n`cacheReadTokens` and is subtracted out of `inputTokens` to keep the\nharness's d"},{"id":"p28s12","text":"isjoint-count convention."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Errors"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Non-2xx responses throw `LlmError` with stable codes. LongCat documents a\ndedicated **402** for exha"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"usted token quota and puts `insufficient_quota` on\n**403**, where most OpenAI-compatible providers u"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"se 429 — both are classified\nas `QUOTA` before the auth and rate-limit buckets, so a depleted balanc"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"e is\nnever reported as a bad key or retried as a transient rate limit."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Condition | Code |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| 402, or quota detail at any status | `QUOTA_EXCEEDED` |\n| 401 / 403 | `AUTH` |\n| 429 | `RATE_LIMIT"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"` |\n| 400 with context-overflow detail | `CONTEXT_WINDOW_EXCEEDED` |\n| other 400 | `INVALID_REQUEST`"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" |\n| 5xx | `SERVER` |\n| no `[DONE]` / bad JSON | `STREAM_CLOSED` / `MALFORMED_RESPONSE` |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"A completed stream that opened no content blocks becomes a `finish` error with\n`EMPTY_RESPONSE`, whi"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ch the shipped retry policy treats as retryable."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Tests"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"`test:e2e` drives the built adapter's own serialize → SSE → translate pipeline\nagainst `api.longcat."},{"id":"p36s2","text":"chat`, so it verifies what the plugin actually sends\nrather than a hand-written approximation. It is"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" what caught the null-name\ndelta bug."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- **No image input.** LongCat-2.0 reports `modality: text->text`, so image\ncontent is refused before"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" sending, naming the model.\n- **No stop sequences.** `stop` is absent from `supported_parameters`; p"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"assing\none fails with `UNSUPPORTED_OPTION` rather than silently running past it.\n- **Reasoning is bi"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"nary** — no low/medium/high gradient exists to map."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
